Layout mirrors the C:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- [38;5;10msrc/containers.rs[0m — [38;5;10mgeneric_containers.h[0m. The C header token-pastes an array and a linked list per type via [38;5;10mDECLARE_ARRAY[0m/[38;5;10mDEFINE_ARRAY[0m/[38;5;10mDECLARE_LIST[0m/[38;5;10mDEFINE_LIST[0m; Rust generics express that once as [38;5;10mArray<T>[0m and [38;5;10mList<T>[0m. [38;5;10mARRAY_FOREACH[0m/[38;5;10mLIST_FOREACH[0m become [38;5;10mfor[0m loops over [38;5;10miter()[0m, preserving index order and head→tail order respectively.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10msrc/inventory.rs[0m — [38;5;10minventory.c[0m. [38;5;10mitem_t[0m/[38;5;10morder_t[0m keep their [38;5;10m[u8; 64][0m/[38;5;10m[u8; 32][0m name buffers so [38;5;10mstrncpy[0m truncation is faithful.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10msrc/cstr.rs[0m — [38;5;10mstrncpy[0m/[38;5;10mstrlen[0m/[38;5;10mstrcmp[0m/[38;5;10m%s[0m semantics on those fixed buffers, including stopping at the first NUL.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10msrc/cio.rs[0m — [38;5;10mfgets[0m and the [38;5;10msscanf("%d")[0m conversion.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10msrc/main.rs[0m — [38;5;10mmain.c[0m, including the menu loop.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Behaviors worth calling out, since these are where a naive translation drifts:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mfgets(input, 256, stdin)[0m reads at most 255 bytes and stops [3mafter[23m a newline, leaving the rest of an over-long line in the stream for the next iteration. Using [38;5;10mBufRead::read_line[0m would have swallowed the whole line instead, so [38;5;10mcio::Stdin[0m feeds bytes one at a time and enforces the 255-byte cap. A 300-character line therefore drives two menu iterations, matching C.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10msscanf[0m with [38;5;10m%d[0m goes through glibc's [38;5;10mstrtol[0m path: skip whitespace (including [38;5;10m\v[0m and [38;5;10m\f[0m), optional sign, digits, saturate at [38;5;10mlong[0m bounds, then truncate to [38;5;10mint[0m. So [38;5;10m2147483648[0m becomes [38;5;10m-2147483648[0m → "Invalid choice", and [38;5;10m99999999999999999999[0m saturates to [38;5;10mLONG_MAX[0m and truncates to [38;5;10m-1[0m. Both reproduced.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Two quirks in the C were kept as-is rather than fixed: [38;5;10mcalculate_inventory_stats[0m seeds [38;5;10mmax_price[0m from [38;5;10m0.0[0m while seeding [38;5;10mmin_price[0m from the first element, and it will divide by [38;5;10mtotal_items[0m without a zero check. Neither is reachable with the hardcoded demo data, but the asymmetry is preserved.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Verification: hand-written cases covering all seven menu choices, EOF at various points, malformed and empty input, sign-only and overflow integers, embedded NUL bytes, CRLF, whitespace variants, and lines crossing the 255-byte [38;5;10mfgets[0m boundary — plus 300 randomized text inputs and 200 raw-random-byte inputs. All matched the C byte-for-byte with identical exit status. Nothing in [38;5;10mc_src/[0m was modified, and I removed the temporary C build and fixture files.[0m[0m
